nd trying to restart your device, which sometimes fixes such issues.\n\nKnown issues\n- It incorrectly returns “true” if the microphone is active.\n- It incorrectly returns “true” if you have the “Accessibility › Sound Recognition” system setting enabled.\n- It returns “false” if audio is playing through AirPlay. There is unfortunately no way to detect this.\n- It returns “true” for a while after you end a call, even though no audio is playing."},"searchKeywords":[]},"effectiveBundleIdentifiers":[],"fullyQualifiedTypeName":"Intents_Extension.IsAudioPlayingIntent","identifier":"IsAudioPlayingIntent","isAuthPolExplicit":false,"isDiscoverable":true,"mangledTypeName":"17Intents_Extension20IsAudioPlayingIntentV","mangledTypeNameByBundleIdentifier":{},"mangledTypeNameByBundleIdentifierV2":{},"mangledTypeNameV2":"17Intents_Extension20IsAudioPlayingIntentV","openAppWhenRun":false,"outputFlags":0,"outputType":{"primitive":{"wrapper":{"typeIdentifier":1}}},"parameters":[],"presentationStyle":0,"requiredCapabilities":[],"supportedModes":1,"systemProtocolMetadata":[],"systemProtocolMetadataV2":[],"systemProtocols":[],"title":{"alternatives":[],"key":"Is Audio Playing"},"typeSpecificMetadata":[],"visibilityMetadata":{"assistantOnly":false,"isDiscoverable":true}},"IsBluetoothOnIntent":{"assistantDefinedSchemaTraits":[],"assistantDefinedSchemas":[],"authenticationPolicy":0,"availabilityAnnotations":{"LNPlatformNameWildcard":{"introducedVersion":"*"}},"descriptionMetadata":{"categoryName":{"title":{"alternatives":[],"key":"Bluetooth"}},"descriptionText":{"alternatives":[],"key":"Returns whether Bluetooth is on or off.\n\nNOTE: You need to allow the Bluetooth permission in the main app before using this action."},"searchKeywords":[]},"effectiveBundleIdentifiers":[],"fullyQualifiedTypeName":"Intents_Extension.IsBluetoothOnIntent","identifier":"IsBluetoothOnIntent","isAuthPolExplicit":false,"isDiscoverable":true,"mangledTypeName":"17Intents_Extension19IsBluetoothOnIntentV","mangledTyp